[{"sha":"86454d9dfcecbdac0f7a0830401cddc49c1358f9","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDg2NDU0ZDlkZmNlY2JkYWMwZjdhMDgzMDQwMWNkZGM0OWMxMzU4Zjk","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/86454d9dfcecbdac0f7a0830401cddc49c1358f9","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/86454d9dfcecbdac0f7a0830401cddc49c1358f9","author":{"name":"Fredrik Ekre","email":"ekrefredrik@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-22T11:12:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"Fredrik Ekre","email":"ekrefredrik@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-22T11:12:26Z"},"tree":{"sha":"68c68042972c71f1b36a346916bc3c4f32597dcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/68c68042972c71f1b36a346916bc3c4f32597dcf"},"message":"oidc: fix NewProvider ignoring caller context timeout\n\nNewAuthProviderOIDC received a context with a 30-second timeout from\nits caller, but immediately discarded it by passing context.Background()\nto oidc.NewProvider. This caused both `headscale serve` and\n`headscale configtest` to hang indefinitely if the OIDC issuer was\nunreachable, rather than timing out and returning an error.\n\nFix by passing the caller's ctx to oidc.NewProvider and remove the\nnolint:contextcheck annotation that was suppressing the linter warning\nabout this bug. The annotation was introduced in ce580f82 as part of a\nbulk lint-suppression pass without addressing the underlying issue.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","parents":[{"sha":"33a65052c9aa0bd492b937408b0cf4e618a1bdc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/33a65052c9aa0bd492b937408b0cf4e618a1bdc8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/33a65052c9aa0bd492b937408b0cf4e618a1bdc8"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niIYEABYKAC4WIQQdBnb/7Y4ziHquB63egubV42TAogUCajkYvxAcZnJlZHJpa0Bl\na3JlLnNlAAoJEN6C5tXjZMCidrYBANoOG/RvpuMJN6QixrSuXJWhWZymgxU8IIGj\ngrR42oPYAP0a5ecIwTnrsa2ChuMRv9ZAp7Mx8peZ69Xc1C5nPFH+AQ==\n=qslE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 68c68042972c71f1b36a346916bc3c4f32597dcf\nparent 33a65052c9aa0bd492b937408b0cf4e618a1bdc8\nauthor Fredrik Ekre <ekrefredrik@gmail.com> 1782126722 +0200\ncommitter Fredrik Ekre <ekrefredrik@gmail.com> 1782126746 +0200\n\noidc: fix NewProvider ignoring caller context timeout\n\nNewAuthProviderOIDC received a context with a 30-second timeout from\nits caller, but immediately discarded it by passing context.Background()\nto oidc.NewProvider. This caused both `headscale serve` and\n`headscale configtest` to hang indefinitely if the OIDC issuer was\nunreachable, rather than timing out and returning an error.\n\nFix by passing the caller's ctx to oidc.NewProvider and remove the\nnolint:contextcheck annotation that was suppressing the linter warning\nabout this bug. The annotation was introduced in ce580f82 as part of a\nbulk lint-suppression pass without addressing the underlying issue.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n","verified_at":"2026-06-22T11:13:21Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":27037813410,"node_id":"RRE_lADOEFLz888AAAABGRk1C88AAAAGS5RKog","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/27037813410","actor":{"login":"fredrikekre","id":11698744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjk4NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11698744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredrikekre","html_url":"https://github.com/fredrikekre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredrikekre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredrikekre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredrikekre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredrikekre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredrikekre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredrikekre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredrikekre/r